## CI/CD Implementation and Kubernetes orchestration by Likhitha Reddyvari

This repository is forked from [https://github.com/LondheShubham153/django-notes-app] for learning and demonstration purposes.

### My Contribution:
- Implemented a full CI/CD pipeline using **Jenkins**.
- Created Jenkinsfile for automated build, test, image push, and deployment.
- Integrated DockerHub and GitHub webhooks for continuous delivery.

- Orchestrated the application using Kubernetes, configuring Deployments, Services, Ingress and Secrets for modular and secure setup.
- Ensured secure and efficient deployments by managing secrets and environment variables across the application lifecycle.
